  "agra/fatehpur": ["Fatehpur Sikri", "A red sandstone imperial capital, built by Akbar then abandoned for lack of water."],
  "agra/mehtab-bagh": ["Mehtab Bagh at sunset", "The far bank of the Yamuna, opposite the Taj Mahal, to watch it change color."],
  "agra/baby-taj": ["The Tomb of Itimad-ud-Daulah", "The “Baby Taj,” inlaid with semi-precious stones, which inspired the great one."],
  "goa/vieux-goa": ["The churches of Old Goa", "The Basilica of Bom Jesus and the Sé Cathedral, what remains of the “Rome of the East.”"],
