  "leh-ladakh/hemis": ["Hemis Monastery", "Ladakh’s richest monastery, hidden in a gorge."],
  "amritsar/temple-or": ["The Golden Temple", "The Sikh sanctuary resting on its pool, glittering with gold leaf at night."],
