  "toulouse/canal-midi": ["The Canal du Midi by bike", "Plane trees, locks and barges, on the greenway heading for the Mediterranean."],
  "nantes/machines": ["Les Machines de l’île and the Great Elephant", "A twelve-meter elephant that walks with fifty passengers, in the former shipyards."],
