  "montpellier/saint-guilhem": ["Saint-Guilhem-le-Désert and the Devil’s Bridge", "A Romanesque abbey deep in the Hérault gorges, and a swim beneath the 11th-century bridge."],
  "montpellier/sete": ["Sète and its canals", "Tielles, Bouzigues oysters, Mont Saint-Clair and Valéry’s seaside cemetery."],
  "montpellier/pic-saint-loup": ["Climbing the Pic Saint-Loup", "An hour and a half up through the garrigue, and the whole coast to the Pyrenees from the cross."],
  "biarritz/rocher-vierge": ["The Rocher de la Vierge", "A footbridge by Gustave Eiffel out to the rock, and Atlantic rollers breaking against it."],
