  "rome/trevi": ["The Trevi Fountain in the early morning", "Twenty-six meters of travertine. Before 7 a.m., you almost have it to yourself."],
  "florence/uffizi": ["The Uffizi Gallery", "Botticelli, Leonardo, Caravaggio, and a line that doubles if you haven’t booked."],
  "florence/duomo": ["Brunelleschi’s dome", "Four hundred and sixty-three steps between the two shells, and four million bricks laid without centering."],
