  "florence/chianti": ["Wine tasting in Chianti", "Cypress-covered hills, two estates, and sangiovese explained by the people who make it."],
  "venise/saint-marc": ["St. Mark’s Basilica", "Eight thousand square meters of gold-ground mosaics, and the Pala d’Oro behind the altar."],
